  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LAM 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta o chanamukuŋwiliyi mwana kaZiyona wamumbanda mavu nakuzuwa kwindi! Lubanji lwaIsarela nalufumishi dehi mwiwulu, nalunati dehi heseki. Mwifuku dakuzuwa kwindi hanaanuki nawa itanda dakunyendu yinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta naminyi dehi nyikala yejima yashakamaŋayi Yakoba, nikutiya luwi nehi. Yipaka yindi mwadikaŋililiyi mwana kaYuda wamumbanda nayisandi dehi yejima nandombu yindi. Nayishikŋi dehi niheseki. Natamishi dehi niwanta niatulamba twawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naketuli dehi nseŋu jaIsarela jejima nakuzuwa kwindi kwasweja. Chikasa chindi chachidiilu nachifuntishumu dehi kumesu achilumbu. Namushiti dehi Yakoba bwi neyi kesi kabidimaŋa, kalashalashaŋa kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevuli dehi wuta windi neyi chilumbu; nemani dehi, iku navuŋi chikasa chindi chachidiilu neyi mukwankunyi; antu ejima twatiyilaŋa kuwaha kuyitala, nayijahi dehi kwindi; nasukuli dehi kulendumuka kwindi hetenti damwana kaZiyona wamumbanda neyi kesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nekali dehi chilumbu, naminyi dehi aIsarela. Naminyi dehi matalawu awanta ejima, nakisaŋani dehi yipaka yawu mwadikaŋililuwu. Mudi mwana kaYuda wamumbanda navulishumu dehi kudihomba nakudila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nafumishi dehi tabanaka yindi naŋovu, neyi chelaŋawu itempa. Nakisaŋani dehi chipela chindi chakupompela. Yehova navulameshi dehi nichawija chakushiika nisabata muZiyona, nasekeshi dehi nianyanta niatupristu nandombu yakuzuwa kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nombi dehi kameŋa kindi, naleki dehi malalindi, mbaŋu jakumatalindi awanta wajihana dehi kudi chilumbu. Anabobweli dehi mwitala daYehova, neyi chelilaŋawu hefuku dachawija chakushiika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nafuukuli dehi kukisaŋana mpwembu jamwana kaZiyona wamumbanda. Mwonji wakweseka nachu nawutanjiki dehi, chikasa chindi hanachifuntishumu kulonda chileki kukisaŋanaku. Nimpwembu yakudima nimpwembu yakutuŋa najidilishi dehi makumbu, jinazeeleli dehi kumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenzelu yindi yampwembu yinavumbami dehi hamaseki, nyikomenu yindi nayikisaŋani dehi, nayikotoli dehi. Mwanta windi niatulamba twindi adi kunyuza kwakadi nshimbi. Atuprofwetu twindi hiyanamoni chimwenu chakufuma kudi Yehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulumpi amwana kaZiyona wamumbanda anashakami heseki, chochamwenawu zo-o. Anadisukwili lunkuŋu hanyitu yawu, anavwali yikeleyi. Ajiki amuYerusalema ananoŋami nyitu yawu ndo niheseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumesu ami munomi dehi nakudila, natiyi muchima mwivumu bwi, muchima wami wunamwaŋali dehi heseki mwa-mwa, nakukisaŋana kwanakisaŋanuwu mwana kawantaŋa jami wamumbanda, muloŋa nianyana anyanya, niakwakwamwa adi nakuhwidŋela munyikwakwa yamumukala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakuhwidiŋelawu munyikwakwa yamumukala neyi antu anatapuwu, chamwaŋikaŋa wumi wawu hantulu jawamama jawu, hiyakwihujola amama jawu nawu, Tidi ku navinyu yidi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kaYerusalema wamumbanda, nukukushimwina wunsahwinyi? Nukukufwikŋa neyi chumanyi? Eyi mwana kaZiyona wamujiki, nukukwesekesha nachumanyi kulonda nikukundeji? muloŋa kujilumuka kweyi kunatohi neyi kaluŋalwiji, wukutwesha kukuhizumwisha hinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuprofwetu tweyi anakumweni yimwenu yamukunkulwayi yawusupi. Hiyanabutululi kuluwa kweyi kulonda akufumishi cheŋi muwukoli weyuku. Anakumweni wuprofwetu wamukunkulwayi, anakumweni yuma yakukukinjika nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima akahitaku hiyakukwetela mumakasawu; hiyakumuyiŋila mwana kaYerusalema wamumbanda, hiyakumulembula nanyitu yawu, nawu, Weniwu diwu mukala watenenaŋawu nawu, Dilu lubanji lwamana, diwu wazaŋalelawu iseki dejima, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayilumbu jeyi ejima anakwasa mini mukanwa nankashi. Hiyakuyiŋila, hiyakudisumona kumaji, nawu, Tunamuminyi dehi. Chalala kwaamu, dodifuku twadiŋi nakutalila. Tunadiwani dehi, tunadimoni dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nakoŋi dehi mwafuukwi liyi, namanishi dehi izu dindi dayilejeliyi hamafuku ahashankulu, nakunati dehi heseki, nikutiya luwi nehi. Namutiyishi dehi chilumbu kuwaha nansaŋu yeyi, nemiki dehi nseŋu jawakwankunyi neyi kwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyichima yawu yadililili kudi Yehova. Eyi mpwembu yamwana kaZiyona wamumbanda, madilu eyi apolomoki neyi kaloŋa nimwaana niwufuku. Bayi wunookaku, kantu kadisu deyi bayi kamwenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hindukaku wukaluki nyiteti nawufuku, hachilu hachilu. Mwaŋilaku muchima weyi heseki kumesu aMwanta, neyi meji. Nyamunaku makaseyi, wumwolweli, wulembeleli wumi wawanyaneyi anyanya anazeyi nanzala kunsa janyikwakwa yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, tala wutali awa wunakoŋi mwenimu. Ambanda kwaamu adiyi avwalika mumavumu awu, anyana akataŋawu munkondu? Atupristu nawatuprofwetu ayijahili kwaamu mumalala aMwanta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atwansi nawatushinakaji hiyakukamujoka hamaseki munyikwakwa. Yaŋadima yami ninyikwenzi yami anadimbuki nampoku yakabali. Wunayijahi hefuku deyi dakuzuwa. Wunayijaholi nikutiya luwi nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunantambikili mutentu niniku niniku, neyi chakutambika chipompelu chakudihudika. Kwosi wapulukili hela kushalahu, mwifuku dakuzuwayi Yehova. Awa naakatili munkondu, naleleli, anayinoŋeshi kudi chilumbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
